ADDITIONAL NOTICE — FINANCIAL RISK

This software places real orders on a real exchange with real money when it is
armed. It is published as an engineering reference, not as investment advice,
and nothing in this repository is a recommendation to trade.

The authors make no claim that this strategy is profitable. An extensive
search over alternative rule sets found no variant that survived correction
for multiple comparisons, and the live edge has never been established to a
statistically meaningful standard. Assume you will lose money.

You are solely responsible for any funds you place at risk, for complying with
the laws and tax rules of your jurisdiction, and for complying with the terms
of service of any exchange you connect this software to.
